n":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-09-02T15:34:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T17:38:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4.1 Stable and Godot 4.3 Stable \n\n\n### System information\n\nPixel8a - Android 14, Chrome-based preview - Godot 4.4.1 Stable \n\n### Issue description\n\nOn Pixel 8a, any mesh with a skeleton renders correctly on the first run of the game. On the second and all subsequent runs, the meshes with skeletons are no longer visible.\nIf browser cache/data is cleared, the meshes appear again, but only for the first run.\n\nI have tried:\n\nDisabling shader caching (no effect).\n\nReproducing with a simple scene (only a skinned mesh, skeleton, and animation) — the issue still occurs.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Export a Godot 4.4.1 project with a skinned mesh (e.g., Character with Skeleton3D and animation).\n- Open the exported HTML5 build in Chrome on Pixel 8a.\n- Observe that on the first launch, the mesh is visible.\n- Close the tab/browser and re-open the game.\n- The skinned mesh is no longer visible.\n- Clear browser cache → mesh reappears (but disappears again on the next launch).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[skinned-meshes-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22098382/skinned-meshes-bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110197/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110197/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}